==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - head:
      "10":
        - type: css
        - inline: "\nbody {\n    background-color: lightblue;\n}\n    "
==== explainer ====
Use inline to define css in a multiline block <<[ /* css goes here */ ]>>
